        "actionType": {
          "value": "action"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": 2
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The troop looses a suppressing stream of shots. Choose one enemy within the range of the troop's Salvo attack; that enemy attempts a Reflex save against the troop's Battle DC. The penalty is a status penalty and applies to the target's attack rolls and, if the target is a troop, to its Battle and Salvo DCs; any Speed penalty is also a status penalty. Both last until the start of the troop's next turn.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a -1 penalty.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes a -2 penalty and a -5-foot penalty to its Speeds.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes a -3 penalty and a -10-foot penalty to its Speeds.</p>"
        },
